{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"She nods, the faintest hint of a smile on her face. \"I'm Edriata.\" She pulls a few silver out of what you suppose is a pocket but just looks like part of her body. \"I don't have much use for copper, but I'd be more that happy to take an alternative payment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T06:27:36.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864030217324855336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
